BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mandalorian & Grogu
DTSTART:20260610T230000Z
DTEND:20260611T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260610T230000Z
UID:U1yRWsIc7o
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 132 mins (2h12m)\n\nThe Mandalorian and Grogu embark
  on their most thrilling mission yet in Lucasfilm’s Star Wars: The Manda
 lorian and Grogu. The evil Empire has fallen\, and Imperial warlords rema
 in scattered throughout the galaxy. As the fledgling New Republic works to
  protect everything the Rebellion fought for\, they have enlisted the help
  of legendary Mandalorian bounty hunter Din Djarin (Pedro Pascal) and his 
 young apprentice Grogu.   **All 2D Sunday matinees and Tuesday screenings
  will have Open Captions**3D showtimes:May 30 - 5:15pmMay 31 - 2:00pmJune 
 3 - 7:30pm\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/star-wars-the-mandal
 orian-and-grogu\n\nEstimated start: 16:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
